# Project: Church Website

## Brand colours

| Name | Hex | Role |
|---|---|---|
| Deep Violet | `#2E1A46` | Primary / foundation |
| Aqua Teal | `#2ED9C3` | Primary call-to-action |
| Warm Orange | `#FF6C0E` | Accent / announcements |

---

## Colour usage rules

### Deep Violet (`#2E1A46`) — foundation colour
Use for navigation bar, hero/banner backgrounds, footer, and dark feature sections. Creates authority and calm. Never use orange text on this background — the contrast ratio fails WCAG accessibility standards.

### Aqua Teal (`#2ED9C3`) — primary CTA
Reserve for the most important interactive elements: primary buttons ("Plan your visit", "Watch sermon", "Give"), links, and icons placed on the violet background. Do not use as a decorative or background colour.

### Warm Orange (`#FF6C0E`) — accent
Use sparingly — one or two highlights per page maximum. Suitable for announcements, event tags, countdown banners, and secondary buttons. Overuse reduces its impact and makes the page feel chaotic. Never use as the primary CTA on the same page as teal.

### Body sections
Use white (`#FFFFFF`) or a very light neutral background for content-heavy sections (sermon archives, About page, blog). This gives visual breathing room between bold coloured sections and ensures long-form text is readable.

---

## Shade scales

Each brand colour has a 10-stop tint-to-shade scale. Use the correct stop for each context.

### Violet scale
| Stop | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| 50 | `#F2EFF7` | Section background tints |
| 100 | `#D9D0EC` | Tags, sidebar highlights, event calendar cells |
| 200 | `#B9A9D8` | Card or input borders |
| 300 | `#9A84C0` | Decorative icons, inactive nav items |
| 400 | `#7A61A8` | Icon fills, secondary text on dark backgrounds |
| 500 | `#5A4190` | Hover states for links, secondary headings in dark sections |
| 600 | `#2E1A46` | **Brand colour** — nav, hero, footer |
| 700 | `#251538` | Hover/active state on dark backgrounds |
| 800 | `#1A0E28` | Very dark section backgrounds |
| 900 | `#100819` | Headings placed on violet-tinted backgrounds (50/100) |

### Teal scale
| Stop | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| 50 | `#E3FAF8` | Info boxes, scripture quote backgrounds |
| 100 | `#B0F1E9` | "New" badges, volunteer tags |
| 200 | `#7CE8D9` | Hover fill for outlined teal buttons |
| 300 | `#4DDECB` | Soft CTA on white backgrounds |
| 400 | `#2ED9C3` | **Brand colour** — primary buttons, links, icons on violet |
| 500 | `#20B8A5` | Link colour on white/light backgrounds |
| 600 | `#148F80` | Button hover/active state |
| 700 | `#0C6B5F` | Accent borders and underlines on white |
| 800 | `#074E45` | Text on light teal backgrounds (50–200) |
| 900 | `#03332E` | Headings on teal-tinted backgrounds (50) |

### Orange scale
| Stop | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| 50 | `#FFF3EB` | Warm section tints (giving, mission) |
| 100 | `#FFD9BB` | Soft highlights, featured testimonial cards |
| 200 | `#FFBC8A` | "Featured" or "Today" event tags |
| 300 | `#FF9A54` | Decorative icon fills, progress bars |
| 400 | `#FF6C0E` | **Brand colour** — announcements, event tags, secondary buttons |
| 500 | `#E05800` | Button hover state |
| 600 | `#B84700` | Button active/pressed state |
| 700 | `#8F3700` | Borders on urgent or countdown banners |
| 800 | `#662800` | Text on orange 100–200 backgrounds |
| 900 | `#3D1800` | Headings on orange-tinted backgrounds (50) |

---

## Contrast and accessibility

- Text on a 50 or 100 background: use the 800 or 900 stop of the same colour family.
- Never place orange text on the violet background — fails WCAG contrast.
- Never place both teal and orange as CTAs on the same page — assign one role per colour.
- White text is safe on violet 600–900, teal 600–900, and orange 500–900.
- Dark text (`#1a1040` or the 900 stop) is required on teal 400 and lighter.

---

## Component patterns

### Navigation
Background: Violet 600 (`#2E1A46`). Brand name: white. Nav links: `rgba(255,255,255,0.65)`. CTA button: Orange 400 (`#FF6C0E`) with white text.

### Hero section
Background: Violet 600. Heading: white. Subtext: `rgba(255,255,255,0.65)`. Primary button: Teal 400 with dark text (`#1a1040`). Secondary button: ghost style (white border, white text).

### Sermon / event cards
Background: Violet 600. Category tag: Orange 400. Title: white. Metadata: `rgba(255,255,255,0.6)`. Action button: Teal 400 with dark text.

### Announcement banners
Background: Orange 50 or 100. Left border accent: Orange 400. Text: Orange 900.

### Body sections (e.g. About, archive)
Background: white or neutral light grey. Standard dark body text. Teal 500 for inline links.

### Footer
Background: Violet 800 or 900. Text: white and `rgba(255,255,255,0.6)`.
